                </xs:annotation>
              </xs:attribute>
              <xs:attribute name="FileName" use="optional" type="xs:token">
                <xs:annotation>
                  <xs:documentation>
							Optional file name to indicate the file from which the content originated, or to suggest a name to use when saving the content.
